  "instructions": [
    "Heat the sesame oil in the cataplana over medium-high heat",
    "Add the sliced pork and cook until browned, about 5 minutes",
    "Add the diced apples and cook until they start to soften, about 3 minutes",
    "Add the gochujang, soy sauce, and brown sugar, and stir to combine",
    "Add the minced garlic and grated ginger, and stir to combine",
    "Reduce heat to low and simmer, covered, for 10 minutes",
    "Stir in 1 tablespoon of water to emulsify the sauce",
    "Serve hot, garnished with green onions and toasted sesame seeds"
